## 2. End-to-end: GET /v1/admin/stats với 2 exit node (wg + ssh giả lập)
Setup: node vn-hn (local, 3 peer: 2 online/1 stale) + node sg-1 qua ssh_target (1 online/1 stale).
        wg stub + ssh stub trong PATH, DRY_RUN=0, PORT=18102.
```
$ curl -s -H 'Authorization: Bearer <AUTH_TOKEN>' http://127.0.0.1:18102/v1/admin/stats
$ ssh stub được gọi cho node remote:
  CALLED: -o BatchMode=yes -o StrictHostKeyChecking=accept-new -o ConnectTimeout=8 -i /tmp/pvpn-verify/fake_key root@203.0.113.10 wg show wg0 dump

connections_totals   : {"online":3,"total":4,"nodes":2}
by_node (chart server):
   Vietnam Hanoi    online=2 peer=3 | Hanoi, VN
   Singapore 1      online=1 peer=1 | Singapore, SG
by_location (chart ISP): {"totbb":1,"google":1,"myrepublic (SG)":1}
online_devices (bảng):
   vn-hn  iPhone cua Minh  ios      ip=203.113.10.5    isp=totbb      cc=- connected=13s rx/tx=1048576/2097152
   sg-1   (chưa đăng ký)   -        ip=103.6.150.9     isp=myrepublic cc=SG connected=21s rx/tx=777/888
   vn-hn  Pixel 9          android  ip=8.8.8.8         isp=google     cc=- connected=96s rx/tx=2048/4096
back-compat (không đổi field cũ): totals = {"devices":2,"test_devices":0,"users":0,"active_devices":2,"revoked_devices":0,"online_peers":3,"total_peers":4,"exit_nodes":2}
back-compat online_peer_endpoints = [{"ip":"203.113.10.5","count":1},{"ip":"8.8.8.8","count":1},{"ip":"103.6.150.9","count":1}]
```

